!! Milestones ~ the landmarks the road walks toward (operator, 2026-11-06; the dogfood stand, 2026-11-07)

The operator set these landmarks in a coffee talk (2026-11-06: //"M6 before the rite; write them into the road, M5 pulls hardest right now."//), and the dogfood/keeper split (2026-11-07, #/rulings) set the dogfood stand ahead of `M4`, with `M5` as the spine after it and the harness moving into the Lararium after `M5`'s memory stage. The table reads in walking order. Each milestone names the state that stands when its items land; the items themselves keep their strides and #/the-order's ranks. The landmark map walks the road backwards from the hearth through the code and names the shortest path (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/landmark-map`>>).

